# Ad-hoc browser smoke scripts. These get written at the repo root so `node`
# can resolve playwright from node_modules, which means a `git add -A` will
# happily commit one — it already did once (ui-final.mjs). Real, reusable
# measurement scripts belong in tools/measure/ and are not matched here.
